    <id>https://www.strangerfoods.org/recipes/potato-rosti-with-smoked-ham-and-eggs</id>
    <title>Potato rösti with smoked ham and eggs</title>
    <updated>2026-10-13T16:51:55.552839+00:00</updated>
    <content type="html">&lt;h1 style="text-align:center;font-family:sans-serif;"&gt;Potato rösti with smoked ham and eggs&lt;/h1&gt;
        &lt;br&gt;
        &lt;img src="https://www.strangerfoods.org/images/potato-rosti-with-smoked-ham-and-eggs.webp" style="text-align:center;"/&gt;
        &lt;br&gt;
        &lt;p style="font-family:sans-serif;&gt;Just a handful of humble ingredients come together here for a joyous lunch (or even breakfast) that’s far easier to make in a roasting pan than in a frying pan. As ever, keep your eyes glued to the eggs as they bake: all ovens are different and you want the yolks to spill their loveliness over the rösti when you cut into them, not require a carving knife.&lt;/p&gt;</content>
    <link href="https://www.strangerfoods.org/recipes/potato-rosti-with-smoked-ham-and-eggs"/>
    <published>2026-10-03T00:00:00+00:00</published>
